Feature: beforeEach scope
  Scenario: first scoped scenario
    Given first scoped setup
    When the first scenario runs
    Then it succeeds

  Scenario: nested scoped scenario
    Given first scoped setup
    And nested scoped setup
    When the nested scenario runs
    Then it succeeds

  Scenario: sibling scoped scenario
    Given first scoped setup
    When the sibling scenario runs
    Then it succeeds
